msgid "Wayland/X11"
msgstr "Wayland/X11"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

msgid "When to use Wayland"
msgstr "Wayland 的适用场景"

msgid ""
"If you're an engine developer who wants to help improve support, or if you "
"think Xwayland might be causing visual glitches in your exported project for "
"whatever reason, then we would recommend using Wayland. But outside of that "
"it's recommended to stick with X11 for now. It's important to note that "
"while X11 applications can run on Wayland, the reverse is not true."
msgstr ""
"如果你是希望帮助改进支持的引擎开发人员，或者你认为 Xwayland 可能因某些原因导"
"致导出的项目出现视觉瑕疵，那么我们建议你使用 Wayland。但除此之外，目前仍建议"
"坚持使用 X11。需要注意的是，虽然 X11 应用程序可以在 Wayland 上运行，但反过来"
"却不成立。"

